{
  "_comment": "Source of truth for the app's CSS custom properties. Run `bun run tokens` after any change; scripts/app-tokens.test.ts fails when src/tokens.ts is stale, and measures every contrast claim below with site/scripts/check-contrast.mjs. Three layers: primitives (color, font, text, space, radius, shadow), semantic (what a value means) and component (what one part of the UI uses). Values are the Mix (docs/app-v4/mockups/README.md): Warm paper's palette and type on Native's layout, with a glass material on navigation and floating controls.",
